	<data type="text">
		<id>text_2</id>
		<title/>
		<init>&lt;p&gt;Here you will find links to the module descriptions of the modules you have selected. Check the covered content and competencies carefully and enter achievements if you believe that there is no significant difference between your achievements and the module content and competencies. For each entered achievement, also provide the page numbers of the transcripts of records and study contents so that we can check your details. You can submit multiple achievements for each module. If you delete all achievements for a module, this module will not be applied for.&lt;/p&gt;</init>
