	</data>
	<data type="text">
		<id>text_7</id>
		<title/>
		<init>&lt;h1&gt;Application for Information on the Recognition of Examination Achievements&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Examination achievements can be recognized provided there is no significant difference in terms of acquired competencies compared to the achievements to be replaced. Please compare your module descriptions with our &lt;a href="https://www.fernuni-hagen.de/mi/studium/bsc_mathematik/module.shtml" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"&gt;module descriptions&lt;/a&gt; before submitting your application.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Recognition of examination achievements is always only possible for entire modules; partial achievements cannot be recognized.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;When recognizing examination achievements completed at other institutions, the recognition is done without a grade. The grade of a module can only be transferred if the grading systems are comparable and the content and scope of the module match.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The following application must be filled out as follows:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Enter your details.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Upload all achievement descriptions as PDFs. e.g., certificates and transcripts of records.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Upload all content descriptions as PDFs. e.g., module descriptions, tables of contents, excerpts from study guides or examination regulations showing the scope of the courses (ECTS credits or semester weekly hours), the content of the courses, and the form and duration of the examinations. We need these so that a recognition check can be carried out.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</init>
	</data>
